recommend keep-going the correspondence arc has reached the person it was always about, and the parting is the arc's own last courtesy rather than another tier of it. The crux this lap named in a number is the printing staircase -- three lines a rung across every rung holding it, invisible to the byte-identical meter for the same reason the orchestration spine was. A meter beside the spine meter, then a lift into the harness, is the shape the answer already has, and fold D wrote the seam it would use.
